        "National contact follow-up improves to 78.0% (14436/18508), but Tshopo did not report and four named zones lack usable data.",
        "North Kivu remains severely over treatment capacity at 196/141 = 139.0%.",
        "Alert investigation falls to 78.7% nationally and only 18.2% in Sud-Kivu; Tshopo did not report.",
        "Community resistance remains active: Ituri records 14 resistance events in Bunia and none resolved.",
        "No vaccination activity was reported by any province."
